THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
----------------------

The full, generated dependency inventory lives in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md and is
refreshed in CI (cargo-about for the Rust tree, license-checker for the npm
tree). It is also shown in-app under Settings -> Advanced, as GPL-3 requires.
The summary below covers the primary components and is not a substitute for that
file.

  gitoxide (gix)          MIT OR Apache-2.0
  Tauri 2                 MIT OR Apache-2.0
  serde, serde_json       MIT OR Apache-2.0
  notify                  CC0-1.0 OR Artistic-2.0
  Svelte / SvelteKit      MIT
  Vite                    MIT

All are compatible with distribution inside a GPL-3.0-or-later work.


FONTS
-----

The interface uses the host platform's system font stack unless a face is
chosen in Settings › Reading. The fonts below are bundled, so the application
works offline; each one's licence text sits beside its file.

  Sora (the wordmark, FEAT-085)            SIL Open Font License 1.1
    assets/brand/font/Sora.ttf, OFL.txt
  Atkinson Hyperlegible (FEAT-090)         SIL Open Font License 1.1
    Copyright 2020 Braille Institute of America, Inc.
    assets/fonts/atkinson-hyperlegible/
  Atkinson Hyperlegible Mono (FEAT-090)    SIL Open Font License 1.1
    Copyright 2020-2024 The Atkinson Hyperlegible Mono Project Authors
    assets/fonts/atkinson-hyperlegible-mono/
  Lexend (FEAT-090)                        SIL Open Font License 1.1
    Copyright 2018 The Lexend Project Authors, Reserved Font Name
    "RevReading Lexend"
    assets/fonts/lexend/
  JetBrains Mono (FEAT-090)                SIL Open Font License 1.1
    Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
    assets/fonts/jetbrains-mono/
  OpenDyslexic Mono 1.001 (FEAT-090)       Bitstream Vera Fonts licence
    Abbie Gonzalez; the monospaced cut is published only under the Bitstream
    Vera licence, not the OFL that covers the later proportional OpenDyslexic.
    The Bitstream Vera licence is permissive and GPL-compatible; it permits
    redistribution inside a larger software package and asks that a modified
    font not keep the names "Bitstream" or "Vera". The file is unmodified.
    assets/fonts/opendyslexic-mono/

The design handoff wireframes used "Architects Daughter" to signal draft
status; it is deliberately not shipped.


